<title>POLAND: DOM-PLAST FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 640,000.</title>
<headline>DOM-PLAST FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 640,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.64 vs   1.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.10 vs   1.89</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.26 vs   1.87</p>
<p> Sales		    6.63 vs   6.66</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.27 vs   2.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.19 vs   3.54</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.32 vs   3.53</p>
<p> Sales		   13.25 vs  12.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastic houseware maker is</p>
<p>Dom-Plast SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
